  7	
  8	For complex numbers $\alpha,\beta \in \C$, write $\alpha \approx_\eps \beta$ when $|\alpha-\beta|\le \eps$. In particular,
  9	\begin{equation}\label{eq:triangle-inequality-for-numbers}
 10		\text{if $\alpha \approx_{\eps} \beta$ and $\beta \approx_{\delta} \gamma$, then $\alpha \approx_{\eps+\delta}\gamma$.}
 11	\end{equation}
