116	G^{\mathrm{A}}_{[g(u)=a]} \otimes I \simeq_{2\sigma + 2\sqrt{3\eps + 2\sigma}} I \otimes G^{\mathrm{B}}_{[g(u)=a]}.
117	\end{equation*}
118	This implies that
