127	& \geq \E_{\bu} \sum_{g \neq h}  \bra{\psi} G^{\mathrm{A}}_{g} \ot G^{\mathrm{B}}_{h} \ket{\psi} - \frac{md}{q}.
128	\end{align*}
129	Rearranging, we get
